{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfmhY789zuYeZxTuW6vkT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AnhsQydN38HyDYYyLc6r1i","name":"Workflow","input":{"script":"export const meta = {\n  name: 'ship-verify-2026-10-06',\n  description: 'Adversarially verify the ship-phase output of one-a-day 2026-10-06 before marking ship done',\n  phases: [\n    { title: 'Verify', detail: 'four independent read-only lenses try to refute the ship' },\n  ],\n}\n\nconst REPO = 'C:\\\\src\\\\m0saic-production\\\\one-a-day'\nconst COMMON = `\nYou are verifying the SHIP phase of the one-a-day repo at ${REPO} (date 2026-10-06, template @one-a-day/community/weekly-run-report/v1, pick = variant a).\nSTRICT RULES — breaking any of these discards the whole day:\n- READ-ONLY. Do not edit, create, move or delete any file anywhere, EXCEPT you may write scratch files (image crops, logs) under ${REPO}\\\\journal\\\\2026-10-06\\\\scratch\\\\verify-ship\\\\ (create it if needed).\n- Never run: git commit/push/checkout/reset/tag/add/stash, npm publish, npm run build, npm run verify, npm run previews, npm run fingerprints:update, check-freeze --update, npm run new, npm run submit, or anything in pipeline/ that commits, reverts or pushes (revertPaths, commitAll, runGate, push).\n- Never set M0SAIC_ROOT. If you call 'm0saic make', always pass -o under journal\\\\2026-10-06\\\\scratch\\\\verify-ship\\\\.\n- Your job is to try to REFUTE: find anything false, misleading, out of scope, or that would make the runner's gate fail. Default to reporting a finding when uncertain, with severity 'note'. Do not invent problems you cannot point to with evidence.\nContext you can read: journal/2026-10-06/{state.json,run.json,40-critique.md,30-build.md,20-brief.md,10-scout.md,50-ship.md,trace.json}, journal/2026-10-06/scratch/ (ship-*.log, ship-doctor.json = doctor BEFORE the repo.ts change, ship/doctor-final.json = AFTER), AGENTS.md, pipeline/lib/g